    <li><a href="/fa-loading-dots">Loading Dots</a> <code>FaLoadingDots</code> — "Loading" with a growing/resetting ellipsis</li>
    <li><a href="/fa-helix-loader">Helix Loader</a> <code>FaHelixLoader</code> — twisting, breathing DNA-helix dots</li>
